{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc","published":"2026-11-24T17:42:51Z","modified":"2026-11-24T18:00:04.190752283Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-59192"],"summary":"Cakephp twig-view unserialize Twig filter allows arbitrary object deserialization","details":"### Impact\nThe `unserialize` filter has no restriction on which classes are allowed. This can be used as a deserialization remote-code-execution gadget.\n\n### Patches\n1.3.3 and 2.1.2 contain a fix for this issue. The fix may impact backwards compatibility if you are relying on deserializing PHP objects in your templates.\n\n### Workarounds\nDon't use the `unserialize` filter.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cakephp/twig-view","ecosystem":"Packagist","purl":"pkg:composer/cakephp/twig-view"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.3"}]}],"versions":["1.0.0","1.0.0-RC1","1.0.0-RC2","1.0.0-beta1","1.0.0-beta2","1.0.1","1.0.2","1.1.0","1.1.1","1.2.0","1.3.0","1.3.1","1.3.2"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/11/GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc/GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cakephp/twig-view","ecosystem":"Packagist","purl":"pkg:composer/cakephp/twig-view"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"2.0.0"},{"fixed":"2.1.2"}]}],"versions":["2.0.0","2.0.1","2.0.2","2.0.3","2.1.0","2.1.1"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/11/GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc/GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/cakephp/twig-view/security/advisories/GHSA-48qj-5wxh-m8hc"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59192"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/cakephp/twig-view/pull/119"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/cakephp/twig-view/pull/120"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/cakephp/twig-view/commit/65f5035ee65e76925242fdca2dc2bb0d732b6c1